<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Station 1</title>
  <style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #EEEDFE;
  padding: 20px 12px 40px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}
.wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 460px; }
.top-bar {
  display: flex; align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.badge {
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 14px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold;
}
.num {
  width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;
}
.card {
  background: white; border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(83,74,183,.12);
}
.card h2 { color: #534AB7; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.contexte {
  background: #F1EFE8; border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 13px 15px; font-size: 14px;
  color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.question {
  background: #EEEDFE; border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 14px 15px; font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: bold; color: #26215C; line-height: 1.5;
  border-left: 4px solid #534AB7;
}
.question small {
  display: block; font-weight: normal;
  font-size: 12px; color: #534AB7; margin-top: 6px;
}
.input-row { margin-top: 16px; }
.input-row label {
  display: block; font-size: 12px;
  color: #888; margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.champ {
  width: 100%; padding: 13px 16px;
  font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold;
  border: 3px solid #C8C5F0;
  border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;
  color: #26215C;
}
.btn {
  display: block; width: 100%;
  margin-top: 12px; padding: 15px;
  font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;
  background: #534AB7; color: white;
  border: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer;
}
.btn:active { background: #3C3489; }
.correct {
  background: #E1F5EE;
  border-left: 5px solid #1D9E75;
  border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px;
  margin-top: 14px; display: none;
}
.wrong {
  background: #FAEEDA;
  border-left: 5px solid #BA7517;
  border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px;
  margin-top: 14px; display: none;
}
.titre-ok { color: #0F6E56; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }
.titre-ko { color: #854F0B; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }
.corrige {
  background: #f0fdf7; border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 14px; margin: 12px 0;
  font-size: 13px; color: #27500A;
  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
  line-height: 1.9;
}
.lettre-box { text-align: center; margin: 14px 0; }
.lettre {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 64px; font-weight: 900;
  color: white; background: #1D9E75;
  width: 90px; height: 90px; line-height: 90px;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
.note {
  font-size: 13px; color: #0F6E56;
  text-align: center; font-style: italic; margin-top: 8px;
}
.indice {
  font-size: 14px; color: #633806;
  line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 8px;
}
.retry {
  display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 11px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;
  background: white; color: #BA7517;
  border: 2px solid #BA7517; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
}
.footer {
  text-align: center; font-size: 11px;
  color: #888; margin-top: 20px;
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="top-bar">
    <span class="badge">🔐 Escape Game Maths — PIPAC</span>
    <div class="num">1</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🐔 Station 1/10 — Exponentielle de base q</h2>

    <div class="contexte">
      Un éleveur de volailles suit la croissance de son cheptel.<br><br>
      Au départ <strong>(t = 0)</strong>, il possède <strong>200 poules</strong>.<br>
      Chaque mois, le nombre de poules est <strong>multiplié par 1,5</strong>.
    </div>

    <div class="question">
      Combien de poules l'éleveur possède-t-il au bout de <strong>4 mois</strong> ?
      <small>Calculer N(4) = 200 × 1,5⁴ — arrondir à l'unité</small>
    </div>

    <div class="input-row">
      <label>Tapez votre réponse ci-dessous :</label>
      <input class="champ" type="text" id="rep" placeholder="ex : 1013" autocomplete="off">
      <button class="btn" onclick="tester()">✅ Valider ma réponse</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="correct" id="ok">
    <div class="titre-ok">🎉 Bravo, bonne réponse !</div>
    <div class="corrige">
      N(t) = 200 × 1,5ᵗ<br>
      1,5² = 2,25<br>
      1,5⁴ = 2,25 × 2,25 = 5,0625<br>
      N(4) = 200 × 5,0625 = 1012,5 ≈ 1013 poules
    </div>
    <div class="lettre-box">
      <div class="lettre">M</div>
      <div class="note">📝 Notez cette lettre sur votre feuille de route !</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrong" id="ko">
    <div class="titre-ko">💡 Pas encore... voici un indice :</div>
    <div class="indice">
      Rappel : <strong>N(t) = N₀ × qᵗ</strong> avec N₀ = 200 et q = 1,5.<br><br>
      Calculez 1,5⁴ à la calculatrice puis multipliez par 200.<br><br>
      <em>Astuce : 1,5 × 1,5 = 2,25 puis 2,25 × 2,25 = ?</em>
    </div>
    <button class="retry" onclick="reset()">🔄 Réessayer</button>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">Terminale PIPAC · Établissement ENILIA ENSMIC</div>

</div>

<script>
function tester() {
  var champ = document.getElementById('rep');
  var ok = document.getElementById('ok');
  var ko = document.getElementById('ko');
  var texte = champ.value;
  texte = texte.replace(',', '.');
  texte = texte.trim();
  var nombre = parseFloat(texte);
  ok.style.display = 'none';
  ko.style.display = 'none';
  if (isNaN(nombre)) {
    ko.style.display = 'block';
    return;
  }
  if (nombre >= 1012 && nombre <= 1014) {
    ok.style.display = 'block';
  } else {
    ko.style.display = 'block';
  }
}

function reset() {
  document.getElementById('rep').value = '';
  document.getElementById('ok').style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('ko').style.display = 'none';
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
